        "content": "Before floodwater arrives, you can help clients reduce confusion, protect records, and speed up a future claim. Ask them to review the policy declarations page and coverage now, not after damage occurs. If limits, deductibles, or other details need to change, remind them that updates may not take effect right away."
      },
      {
