        "type": "text",
        "content": "After a flood, you can guide clients through a stressful period with clear, calm steps. They may be dealing with displacement, safety hazards, and damaged property at the same time. Your role is to help them focus first on safety, then on timely notice, documentation, cleanup, and follow-up."
      }
    ]
