        "content": "When clients return home, you should stress safety first. If they smell gas or hear hissing, they should leave immediately and call the gas company from a safe place. They should keep breakers off, boil water until local officials say it is safe, avoid damaged plumbing, photograph spoiled food, and watch for scam artists."
      }
    ]
