        "type": "text",
        "content": "After notice is filed, you should encourage cleanup that prevents further damage while preserving evidence. Clients should separate damaged and undamaged property, protect salvageable items, ventilate the building, and move wet contents to a dry area. They should not discard items before adjuster review unless health risks or local law require disposal, and they should photograph everything first."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
