        "content": "In the NFIP claims process, you will see that adjusters and examiners serve different functions. Adjusters inspect damage, help document loss, and make recommendations. Examiners manage the file and decide whether payment or denial is appropriate. Both roles should reflect fairness, respect, empathy, and timely claim handling, but this course focuses on what adjusters do."
      }
