        "content": "If you work with NFIP claims as an independent adjuster, you must qualify by registration category. Categories include residential, manufactured home or travel trailer, commercial, and condominium under the Residential Condominium Building Association Policy. Experience, estimating ability, NFIP knowledge, and, for larger claims, supervisor recommendations all matter. Staff adjusters follow their write-your-own company procedures."
