        "content": "The proposed **financial framework** changes would support full-risk pricing, reduce future borrowing pressure, and improve claim-paying stability. For you, the practical point is that Congress may try to align reserve funding, reinsurance, and borrowing authority more closely with expected losses so the NFIP can remain solvent and responsive after major floods."
      }
