        "type": "text",
        "content": "The **Flood Insurance Blueprint** encourages states not to rely only on the NFIP. Instead, you would see coordinated work on risk education, mitigation messaging, private market development, local partnerships, and better communication with governments and FEMA. The broader aim is a more flexible flood insurance system with stronger public understanding."
      }
    ]
  },
